                      & SSM  & Single Supervisory Mechanism Dummy \\
                    % & net_public_debt  & General government net debt, percent of GDP  \\
                    % & Public_Revenue  & General government revenue, percent of GDP \\
                     %& Public_expenditure  & General government total expenditure, percent of GDP  \\


    %\hline\hline % inserting double-line
